<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>AGATS2 (Insecure) [with Nicki Minaj]</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Juice WRLD, Nicki Minaj</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">The Party Never Ends 2.0</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2iVpUQJaQjOWGja05zyIj9</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">80 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Translations</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Português</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Українська</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Русский (Russian)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Español</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Polski</p><p ttm:agent="v1">AGATS2 (Insecure) Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">“AGATS2 (Insecure)” sees Juice WRLD and Nicki Minaj collaborate for the lead single to Juice WRLD’s The Party Never Ends. The track is labeled as the follow-up to Juice’s 2017 hit “All Girls Are the Same.”…</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Read More</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Intro: Juice WRLD &amp;</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nicki Minaj</p><p ttm:agent="v1">]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All stand up, oh (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Woah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Is there any way? Is there any way?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">) All stand up, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1: Juice WRLD &amp;</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nicki Minaj</p><p ttm:agent="v1">]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I admit it, another ho got me finished</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Tryna serve heartbreak up like tennis</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Fuck sipping, I'ma codeine gargle</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Babysitter, she gon' give my kids a swallow</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And her nigga hating, got a gun full of hollows</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Load that bitch up, he won't live to see tomorrow</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Still tripping, on fire, I'm blazin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Inhale,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">it's Friday the 13th and guess who playing Jason</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: Juice WRLD]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And your insecurities</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Will get the best of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your insecurities</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Will get the best of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And your insecurities</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Will get the best of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your insecurities</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Will get the best of—</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2: Nicki Minaj,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Juice WRLD</p><p ttm:agent="v1">,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nicki Minaj &amp; Juice WRLD</p><p ttm:agent="v1">]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Bitches screaming, "Demon time" like they was possessed</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Let's keep it real, bitch, you know you was just obsessed (But it's no)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Bad women, no good, bad women</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hotel rooms and</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Versace linens</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Wake up in the morning, scrambling for some Advil</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Last night, last night was too mad real</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In love with the downers, so I took some sad pills</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Jack Daniel's don't hold me still[Bridge: Juice WRLD &amp; Nicki Minaj,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Juice WRLD</p><p ttm:agent="v1">, &amp;</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nicki Minaj</p><p ttm:agent="v1">]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nothing like the plane ride home</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I really hate the plane ride home (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm in L.A. right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Left the heartbreak in Chicago</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: Juice WRLD &amp; Nicki Minaj,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Juice WRLD</p><p ttm:agent="v1">]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And your insecurities</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Will get the best of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your insecurities</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Will get the best of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And your insecurities</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Will get the best of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your insecurities</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Will get the best of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 3: Nicki Minaj]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">None of these niggas can't fuck with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What's up with you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Insecure, me? Nah, that be you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I left all of them to come after you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She want good brain, gotta be the muscle too</p><p ttm:agent="v1">He want the smart girl, gotta be a hustler too</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hoes can't fuck with me and that's just the truth</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Somebody gotta teach her class like a substitute[Bridge: Nicki Minaj]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Is there any way? Is there any way</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We could be mindful of what we say?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Is there any way? Is there any way</p><p ttm:agent="v1">That you would book a different plane, say you'll stay?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: Juice WRLD &amp;</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nicki Minaj</p><p ttm:agent="v1">]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And your insecurities</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Will get the best of me (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Say you'll stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1">)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your insecurities</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Will get the best of me (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Say you'll stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1">)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Outro: Halsey]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">These thoughts in my brain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Say you'll stay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All girls are the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Say you'll stay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You should stay here with me (These thoughts in my brain)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Say you'll stay</p></div></body></tt>